      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=20>- Wheel Bonus Game is triggered when 2 Pink Seashells appear on
    reels 1 and 5.\n- Player may win Free Games, Mega Free Games, Grand Jackpot on
    the wheel.\n- The wheel consists of the following Free and Mega Free Games:\n
    \     - Free Games: 10, 15, 20 or 30 spins\n      - Mega Free Games: 10, 15, or
    25 spins\n- Wheel Bonus ends once the wheel marker lands on a prize and the prize
    is awarded to the player.</size>"
