  m_text: "<size=20>- Player may enter Mega Free Games from winning the Mega Free
    Games prize in the Wheel Bonus.\n- The same amount of Mega Free Games as initially
    awarded is re-triggered if 2 Pink Seashells land\n   on reels 1 and 5.\n- During
    Mega Free Games, whenever a Wild symbol appears on the reels, the Wild Nudge feature\n
    \  is triggered. Mega Free Games ends when there is no more spins remaining.</size>"
